Subject: [DARWIN HARDENING] gerbil: install the static reuse driver helpers

Gerbil copies its Gambit tools explicitly rather than invoking Gambit's install
target. Copy the two required helpers alongside their source-built command
driver. A missing helper fails installation instead of yielding a broken prefix.

diff --git a/src/build.sh b/src/build.sh
--- a/src/build.sh
+++ b/src/build.sh
@@ -122,3 +122,7 @@ build_gambit()
   cp -v gambit/gsi/gsi "${GERBIL_STAGE0}/bin"
   cp -v gambit/gsc/gsc gambit/bin/gambuild-C "${GERBIL_BUILD_PREFIX}/bin"
+  if [ "$(uname -s)" = Darwin ]; then
+    cp -v gambit/bin/gambit-static-object-reuse gambit/bin/gambit-file-sha256 \
+       "${GERBIL_BUILD_PREFIX}/bin" || die
+  fi
   cp -v gambit/include/gambit.h gambit/include/gambit-not*.h "${GERBIL_BUILD_PREFIX}/include"
